# vdxr-park.xrs - the raffle-wedge park, on a desk (session 54).
#
# Models VDXR as MEASURED at the s53 raffle wedge (ENGINE_NOTES bioshockinfinite
# s54): while a session is not FOCUSED the runtime holds shouldRender=0, counts
# only LAYER-CARRYING frames toward re-promotion, and throttles the empty frame
# loop's xrEndFrame to ~87 ms per call - which paced the game to ~10 presents/s
# (the announcer-stops half) while the park (the input-dead half) never released.
#
# Leg A (feed OFF) must PARK: the inline loop submits zero-layer frames under
# shouldRender=0, so the session never earns FOCUSED back - the wedge.
# Leg B (feed ON, the s54 fix) must SELF-HEAL: the pace thread re-submits the
# last healthy layer set, the layered frames earn re-promotion within
# focusFrames of the hold expiring, no manual rescue.
#
# SCOPE: this proves the MOD's behaviour against the sim's model of VDXR. The
# model's three behaviours are each measured facts from 2026-08-11 logs, but VD's
# actual re-promotion trigger (layers vs its own external state) stays a headset
# question - TESTING "S54" carries that A-B-A.
reset
@frames 30
@assert sessionState eq FOCUSED

# The measured VDXR model.
focus policy vdxr-layers
focus norender on
focus throttle 87

# --- Leg A: feed OFF = the measured wedge --------------------------------------
@mod vrpace feed off
focus lose 2000
# Hold expires at 2 s; empty frames must NOT earn FOCUSED. 10 s is ~90 empty
# frames of eligibility at the throttled cadence - if the state machine were
# counting them, it would have promoted ~30 times over.
@wait 10000
@assert sessionState eq VISIBLE
# The manual rescue (models the user's VD dashboard close / re-don).
focus regain
@wait 1000
@assert sessionState eq FOCUSED

# --- Leg B: feed ON = the s54 fix ----------------------------------------------
@mod vrpace feed on
focus lose 2000
# Hold expires at 2 s; the feed's layered frames earn FOCUSED within 3 cycles
# (~300 ms at the throttled ~11 Hz cadence). No rescue on this leg.
@wait 10000
@assert sessionState eq FOCUSED

# --- cleanup + healthy-exit gate -----------------------------------------------
focus norender off
focus throttle 0
focus policy vdxr
@fps 30
